transduction in primary gastrointestinal stromal tumors (GISTs)</article-title><source>Oncogene</source><year>2004</year><volume>23</volume><supplement>22</supplement><fpage>3999</fpage><lpage>4006</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Oncogene||23|3999||bib13|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15007386</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Emile</surname><given-names>JF</given-names></name><name><surname>Lemoine</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Bienfait</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Terrier</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Azoulay</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Debuire</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Length analysis of polymerase chain reaction products: a sensitive and reliable technique for the detection of mutations in KIT exon 11 in gastrointestinal stromal tumors</article-title><source>Diagn Mol Pathol</source><year>2002</year><volume>11</volume><supplement>2</supplement><fpage>107</fpage><lpage>112</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Diagn Mol Pathol||11|107||bib14|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12045714</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Emile</surname><given-names>JF</given-names></name><name><surname>Theou</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Tabone</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Cortez</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Terrier</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Chaumette</surname><given-names>MT</given-names></name><name><surname>Julie</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Bertheau</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Lavergne-Slove</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname