ft" valign="top" charoff="50">71233</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Colon</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">wt</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">7339</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">979&#x02009;572</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">71385</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Intestine</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">wt</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">197&#x02009;507</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">152&#x02009;647</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tbfnote1"><label>a</label><p>KIT and phosphoKIT correspond to the chemiluminescent intensity mesured on blots and repported to 18&#x02009;<italic>&#x003bc;</italic>g of total protein extract for KIT, and a chemoluminescent signal of total KIT at 7000 for phosphoKIT.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>